{"id":"78077d539058b62d","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-inner-passive-premouse.md","title":"ZFC Inner Passive Premouse","display":"df-zfc-inner-passive-premouse — ZFC Inner Passive Premouse","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner-passive-premouse","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner-passive-premouse"],"display":"df-zfc-inner-passive-premouse — ZFC Inner Passive Premouse","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner-passive-premouse"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner-passive-premouse</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner-passive-premouse — ZFC Inner Passive Premouse"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab819650b6d5d52d\" href=\"?note=ab819650b6d5d52d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,M,\\vec E,F\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal M,M,\\vec E,F\\in V\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=\\langle M,F\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal M=\\langle M,F\\rangle\\)</span> records a premouse core and its possible active extender</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\">\\(\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\\)</span> is the premouse predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab819650b6d5d52d\" href=\"?note=ab819650b6d5d52d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerPassivePremouse}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerPassivePremouse}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}passive\\text{-}premouse} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInnerPassivePremouse}_S(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow \\exists M,\\vec E\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal M=\\langle M,\\emptyset\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}passive\\text{-}premouse} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInnerPassivePremouse}_S(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow \\exists M,\\vec E\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal M=\\langle M,\\emptyset\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Passivity is the empty active-extender coordinate; extenders internal to the premouse sequence <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec E\">\\(\\vec E\\)</span> are not thereby forced to be empty.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md","status":"resolved","id":"ab819650b6d5d52d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md","status":"resolved","id":"ab819650b6d5d52d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)$ is the premouse predicate (see [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal M,M,\\vec E,F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M=\\langle M,F\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerPassivePremouse}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}passive\\text{-}premouse} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInnerPassivePremouse}_S(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow \\exists M,\\vec E\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal M=\\langle M,\\emptyset\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\vec E","display":false}],"bytes":1105,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2341","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-inner-passive-premouse.md|58-df-zfc-inner-passive-premouse]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ab819650b6d5d52d"]}